            <t index="367" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:20:54,452</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:57,024</end-time>
                <translation>其他所有的一切</translation>
                <original>その他のすべてのものは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="368" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:20:57,024</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:01,714</end-time>
                <translation>都会被征服一切的时间所摧毁</translation>
                <original>すべての克服者たる時がついえさせてしまう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="369" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:01,714</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:03,940</end-time>
                <translation>大地的力量会消亡
地の力も滅び</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="370" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:03,940</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:07,060</end-time>
                <translation>身体的力量也会消亡</translation>
                <original>体の力も滅びる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="371" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:07,060</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:08,976</end-time>
                <translation>同样的心意
同じ心が</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="372" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:08,976</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:11,074</end-time>
                <translation>在朋友之间</translation>
                <original>友の間にも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="373" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:11,074</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:13,738</end-time>
                <translation>也在国与国之间</translation>
                <original>国と国との間にも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="374" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:13,738</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:16,220</end-time>
                <translation>绝不会一成不变</translation>
                <original>不動であることは決してない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="375" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:18,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:20,562</end-time>
                <translation>或迟或早</translation>
                <original>遅かれ早かれ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="376" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:20,562</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:23,427</end-time>
                <translation>欢乐会转为痛苦</translation>
                <original>楽しみは苦しみに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="377" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:23,427</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:27,300</end-time>
                <translation>然后又再转为爱</translation>
                <original>そして再び愛に転ずる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="378" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:30,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:34,557</end-time>
                <translation>当思考最终守护国家的原理是什么时</translation>
                <original>結局その国を守る原理っていうのは何なのかと考えた時に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="379" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:34,557</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:37,841</end-time>
                <translation>比起在战争中占据优势</translation>
                <original>戦争を有利に戦うっていうことよりも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="380" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:37,841</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:41,034</end-time>
                <translation>他更强调人与人之间的信赖关系</translation>
                <original>これは人と人の信頼関係とか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="381" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:41,034</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:43,051</end-time>
                <translation>或是爱</translation>
                <original>愛とか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="382" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:43,051</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:46,040</end-time>
                <translation>这些才是守护国家的</translation>
                <original>ということこれこそが国家を守る</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="383" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:46,040</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:48,990</end-time>
                <translation>一大原则</translation>
                <original>一つの大原則なのだという</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="384" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:48,990</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:52,127</end-time>
                <translation>原来如此 所谓和平</translation>
                <original>なるほど平和っていうのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="385" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:52,127</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:55,157</end-time>
                <translation>基本上就是战争与战争之间的间隙啊</translation>
                <original>基本的には戦争と戦争の間なんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="386" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:21:55,157</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:00,065</end-time>
                <translation>可以说 那不过是所谓的战间期或休战期罢了</translation>
                <original>言うなれば戦間期というか休戦期に過ぎないわけです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="387" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:00,065</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:03,280</end-time>
                <translation>大致上 上一场战争结束后</translation>
                <original>でだいたい前の戦争が終わって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="388" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:03,280</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:06,342</end-time>
                <translation>会有一段短暂的和平时期</translation>
                <original>ちょっと束の間の平和の期間があって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="389" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:06,342</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:07,929</end-time>
                <translation>然后下一场战争又会开始</translation>
                <original>また次の戦争始まるんだけども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="390" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:07,929</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:10,247</end-time>
                <translation>而人们往往就在这和平的年代里</translation>
                <original>だいたいこの平和な時代に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="391" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:10,247</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:12,491</end-time>
                <translation>忘记了上一场战争的悲惨</translation>
                <original>前の戦争の悲惨さを忘れるんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="392" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:13,476</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:15,880</end-time>
                <translation>日本自第二次世界大战（太平洋战场）以来</translation>
                <original>日本もアジア太平洋戦争から</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="393" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:15,880</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:18,494</end-time>
                <translation>也已过去了70年的岁月</translation>
                <original>70年という歳月っていうのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="394" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:18,494</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:24,807</end-time>
                <translation>这段时间足以让人将其遗忘一次了</translation>
                <original>一回それが忘れられるに十分な歳月ではあったと思うんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="395" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:24,807</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:27,420</end-time>
                <translation>但是 当我们蓦然回首历史</translation>
                <original>でもふと歴史を振り返ってみると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="396" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:27,420</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:30,780</end-time>
                <translation>啊 原来2000年前的人 2500年前的人</translation>
                <original>ああ2000年前の人も2500年前の人も</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="397" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:30,780</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:33,164</end-time>
                <translation>也有着同样的经历</translation>
                <original>同じ経験してるなということは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="398" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:33,164</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:35,573</end-time>
                <translation>这一点 我们是能够学到的</translation>
                <original>学べるわけですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="399" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:35,573</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:36,620</end-time>
                <translation>现代日本人或许会想</translation>
                <original>現代の日本人って</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="400" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:36,620</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:40,061</end-time>
                <translation>这似乎是完全无关的世界的故事</translation>
                <original>全く縁も縁もないような世界の話とは思いながらも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="401" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:40,061</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:42,944</end-time>
                <translation>但还是能找到一些共鸣之处吧</translation>
                <original>なんか共感できるところがありましたでしょ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="402" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:42,944</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:46,119</end-time>
                <translation>对刚才你说的那些话 我会有强的共鸣</translation>
                <original>今のお話にもすごい共感できるのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="403" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:46,119</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:48,765</end-time>
                <translation>他认为战争作为人类的本性</translation>
                <original>人類のその本性として</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="404" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:48,765</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:50,240</end-time>
                <translation>虽然战争迟早会来</translation>
                <original>いつかは戦争なんだろうけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="405" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:50,240</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:52,286</end-time>
                <translation>希望它来得更晚一些</translation>
                <original>もっと先の方が良かった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="406" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:52,286</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:54,990</end-time>
                <translation>是否采取了避免其发生的行动</translation>
                <original>起こらなきゃいいという行動を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="407" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:54,990</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:58,344</end-time>
                <translation>这差别是很大的 其中也有这层意思</translation>
                <original>したかしないかって結構でかいっていうことがちょっと入ってる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="408" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:22:58,344</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:00,620</end-time>
                <translation>这是我的感受 稍微有些个人化</translation>
                <original>俺の響き方はそういうちょっと響き方で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="409" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:00,620</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:03,836</end-time>
                <translation>原来如此 原来如此 所以啊 每个人</translation>
                <original>なるほどなるほどだから個々の人がね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="410" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:03,836</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:07,321</end-time>
                <translation>基于自己的真实想法</translation>
                <original>そういう自分の真偽に基づいて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="411" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:07,321</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:09,565</end-time>
                <translation>做出新的选择</translation>
                <original>新しい選択をするという</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="412" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:09,565</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:11,591</end-time>
                <translation>这其中是负有责任的</translation>
                <original>その責任はあるということは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="413" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:11,591</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:13,616</end-time>
                <translation>这一点 我们是可以领会到的呢</translation>
                <original>受け取れますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="414" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:13,616</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:15,580</end-time>
                <translation>我觉得很厉害的是 作品虽然经过了2500年</translation>
                <original>すげえなと思うのはやっぱり2500年経って</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="415" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:15,580</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:16,880</end-time>
                <translation>在我们面前仍然如此具体鲜活</translation>
                <original>具体的に浮かぶっていう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="416" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:16,880</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:20,495</end-time>
                <translation>当我们站在自己的立场上看这个故事时
自分の立場でこの物語を見た時</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="417" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:20,495</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:22,100</end-time>
                <translation>感觉非常具体呢</translation>
                <original>すごく具体的にきますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="418" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:22,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:24,728</end-time>
                <translation>从他最后对女儿说的话里也能感受到</translation>
                <original>なんか最後に娘にかけた言葉からも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="419" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:24,728</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:27,900</end-time>
                <translation>哎呀 你们真是辛苦了 为了养活我</translation>
                <original>いやーお前たち重かったなー俺を養うために</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="420" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:27,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:29,709</end-time>
                <translation>但是 谢谢你们</translation>
                <original>でもありがとう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="421" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:29,709</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:32,830</end-time>
                <translation>这句话中的那种信念</translation>
                <original>っていうなんかその信じるものは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="422" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:32,830</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:34,080</end-time>
                <translation>就在那里 这一点</translation>
                <original>そこなんだっていうところに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="423" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:34,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:36,497</end-time>
                <translation>真的让人不禁热泪盈眶</translation>
                <original>本当にうるっとしちゃう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="424" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:36,497</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:38,924</end-time>
                <translation>哎呀 岛田老师 真的很有趣啊</translation>
                <original>いやー島田さん本当に面白かったです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="425" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:38,924</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:42,829</end-time>
                <translation>如果可能的话 真希望这是我写的作品呢</translation>
                <original>できればね私が書いた作品だったらよかったんですけどね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="426" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:42,829</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:44,860</end-time>
                <translation>那么下次就讲岛田老师的作品吧</translation>
                <original>じゃあ次回は島田さんの作品で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="427" id="" vertical="0" torder="1" hasRuby="0" time="">
                <start-time>00:23:44,860</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:47,020</end-time>
                <translation>-非常感谢 -非常感谢</translation>
                <original>-ありがとうございました -ありがとうございました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
